      <table class="ai-model-table ai-model-table--prose">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Date</th>
            <th scope="col">Source</th>
            <th scope="col">Quoted claim</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>23 Dec 2024</td>
            <td><a href="https://x.ai/news/series-c">Series C</a></td>
            <td>100,000 Nvidia Hopper GPUs operating in 122 days; plan to double to a combined 200,000 Hopper GPUs (Spectrum-X called out).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>20 May 2025</td>
            <td>Musk via CNBC</td>
            <td>200,000 installed in Memphis.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Fetched 13 Sep 2026</td>
            <td><a href="https://x.ai/colossus">x.ai/colossus</a></td>
            <td>Built in 122 days, doubled in 92 days to 200k GPUs. Hero: 200,000 H100 GPUs in one cluster. Same page also shows 180K NVIDIA H100 GPUs in one cluster. Roadmap to 1M GPUs. Timeline graphic: 276 days, May 2024 to Feb 2025.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
